      "value": "<p>A beastheart never fights alone! You travel with a ferocious beast by your side—no trained pet, but an untamed creature such as a wolf, a basilisk, or even a young dragon. Bound to you by a primordial connection, your companion honors your wishes just as you are guided by their instincts. </p><p>But beware! As battle rages on, your companion may succumb to a blood-soaked rampage, lashing out at enemies and friends alike.</p>",
      "director": ""
    },
